<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Hoja de Acuerdos — {{inquilino.empresa}}</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,600;0,9..40,700;1,9..40,400&family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  />
  <style>
    :root {
      --parks-green: #006837;
      --parks-green-deep: #004d29;
      --parks-lime: #8dc63f;
      --ink: #1a1f1c;
      --ink-soft: #4a554f;
      --muted: #6b756f;
      --line: #d7e0d9;
      --paper: #f7faf7;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --draft: #9a3412;
      --draft-bg: #fff7ed;
      --draft-line: #fdba74;
      --signed: #006837;
      --signed-bg: #ecf8ef;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html,
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at top left, rgba(0, 104, 55, 0.07), transparent 42%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at top right, rgba(141, 198, 63, 0.08), transparent 36%),
        #eef2ef;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .page-shell {
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 880px;
      padding: 28px 20px 48px;
    }

    .document {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow:
        0 1px 2px rgba(26, 31, 28, 0.04),
        0 18px 40px rgba(0, 77, 41, 0.08);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .brand-bar {
      background: linear-gradient(
        105deg,
        var(--parks-green-deep) 0%,
        var(--parks-green) 58%,
        #1a7a42 100%
      );
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      padding: 28px 36px 24px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .brand-bar::after {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--parks-lime), transparent 70%);
      bottom: 0;
      content: '';
      height: 3px;
      left: 0;
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .brand-tag {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      margin: 0;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .doc-meta {
      text-align: right;
    }

    .doc-meta-label {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      margin: 0 0 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .doc-meta-value {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .body {
      padding: 32px 36px 40px;
    }

    .status-row {
      align-items: center;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .status-pill {
      border: 1px solid;
      display: inline-flex;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 7px 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .status-pill.is-draft {
      background: var(--draft-bg);
      border-color: var(--draft-line);
      color: var(--draft);
    }

    .status-pill.is-signed {
      background: var(--signed-bg);
      border-color: rgba(0, 104, 55, 0.28);
      color: var(--signed);
    }

    .ref-line {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .ref-line strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .title-block {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--parks-green);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .title {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 34px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin: 0 0 10px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      font-size: 15px;
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 54ch;
    }

    .parties {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .party-card {
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--parks-green);
      padding: 18px 20px;
    }

    .party-label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .party-name {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin: 0 0 6px;
    }

    .party-detail {
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .intro {
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      max-width: 68ch;
    }

    .intro strong {
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .section-label {
      align-items: center;
      color: var(--parks-green-deep);
      display: flex;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      gap: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .section-label::after {
      background: var(--line);
      content: '';
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
    }

    .metrics {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .metric {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f4f9f5 0%, #ffffff 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 16px 14px;
    }

    .metric-label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .metric-value {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .metric-value span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .metric.is-highlight {
      background: linear-gradient(
        145deg,
        rgba(0, 104, 55, 0.1) 0%,
        rgba(141, 198, 63, 0.12) 100%
      );
      border-color: rgba(0, 104, 55, 0.28);
    }

    .metric.is-highlight .metric-value {
      color: var(--parks-green-deep);
    }

    .details {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }

    .details th,
    .details td {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 12px 16px;
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    .details tr:last-child th,
    .details tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .details th {
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      width: 42%;
    }

    .details td {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .special {
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
    }

    .special h3 {
      color: var(--parks-green-deep);
      font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }

    .special p {
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      margin: 0;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
    }

    .disclaimer {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin: 0 0 36px;
      max-width: 70ch;
    }

    .signatures {
      display: grid;
      gap: 28px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .signature {
      min-height: 120px;
      padding-top: 72px;
    }

    .signature-line {
      border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .signature-role {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin: 0 0 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .signature-name {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .footer {
      align-items: center;
      background: var(--paper);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      font-size: 12px;
      gap: 8px 18px;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 16px 36px;
    }

    .footer strong {
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .page-shell {
        padding: 12px 10px 28px;
      }

      .brand-bar,
      .body,
      .footer {
        padding-left: 20px;
        padding-right: 20px;
      }

      .brand-bar {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .doc-meta {
        text-align: left;
      }

      .title {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      .parties,
      .signatures,
      .metrics {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .metrics {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .parties,
      .signatures,
      .metrics {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media print {
      body {
        background: #fff;
      }

      .page-shell {
        max-width: none;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .document {
        border: none;
        box-shadow: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <article class="document">
      <header class="brand-bar">
        <div class="brand-mark">
          <p class="brand-tag">Parks Industrial</p>
          <h1 class="brand-name">Hoja de Acuerdos</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-meta">
          <p class="doc-meta-label">Documento</p>
          <p class="doc-meta-value">Carta de Intención (LOI)</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="body">
        <div class="status-row">
          {{#if firmada}}
          <span class="status-pill is-signed">Firmada</span>
          {{else}}
          <span class="status-pill is-draft">Borrador — no válido para firma</span>
          {{/if}}
          <p class="ref-line">Referencia <strong>{{referencia}}</strong></p>
        </div>

        <div class="title-block">
          <p class="eyebrow">Acuerdo comercial preliminar</p>
          <h2 class="title">
            {{#if tipoContrato}}{{tipoContrato}}{{else}}Arrendamiento{{/if}}
          </h2>
          <p class="subtitle">
            {{parque.nombre}}{{#if parque.ubicacion}} · {{parque.ubicacion}}{{/if}}
            {{#if nave.identificador}} · Nave {{nave.identificador}}{{/if}}
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="parties">
          <div class="party-card">
            <p class="party-label">Arrendador</p>
            <p class="party-name">Parks Industrial</p>
            <p class="party-detail">
              {{#if ejecutivoAsignado}}Ejecutivo: {{ejecutivoAsignado}}{{else}}Representación comercial{{/if}}
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="party-card">
            <p class="party-label">Arrendatario / Prospecto</p>
            <p class="party-name">{{inquilino.empresa}}</p>
            <p class="party-detail">
              {{#if inquilino.rfc}}RFC {{inquilino.rfc}}{{/if}}{{#if inquilino.repLegalNombre}}{{#if inquilino.rfc}} · {{/if}}Rep. legal: {{inquilino.repLegalNombre}}{{/if}}{{#unless inquilino.rfc}}{{#unless inquilino.repLegalNombre}}Parte interesada en el inmueble{{/unless}}{{/unless}}
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="intro">
          Las partes manifiestan su intención de celebrar un contrato de
          <strong>{{#if tipoContrato}}{{tipoContrato}}{{else}}arrendamiento{{/if}}</strong>
          sobre la nave <strong>{{nave.identificador}}</strong>, conforme a los
          términos comerciales siguientes.
        </p>

        <p class="section-label">Términos clave</p>
        <div class="metrics">
          <div class="metric">
            <p class="metric-label">Superficie</p>
            <p class="metric-value">
              {{hojaAcuerdos.m2Acordados}} <span>m²</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="metric">
            <p class="metric-label">Precio</p>
            <p class="metric-value">
              {{hojaAcuerdos.precioUsdM2}} <span>USD/m²</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="metric is-highlight">
            <p class="metric-label">Renta mensual</p>
            <p class="metric-value">
              {{rentaMensualTotal hojaAcuerdos}} <span>USD</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="metric">
            <p class="metric-label">Plazo</p>
            <p class="metric-value">
              {{hojaAcuerdos.plazoMeses}} <span>meses</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <table class="details">
          <tbody>
            {{#if hojaAcuerdos.fechaInicio}}
            <tr>
              <th>Fecha de inicio</th>
              <td>{{hojaAcuerdos.fechaInicio}}</td>
            </tr>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if hojaAcuerdos.periodoGraciaMeses}}
            <tr>
              <th>Periodo de gracia</th>
              <td>{{hojaAcuerdos.periodoGraciaMeses}} meses</td>
            </tr>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if hojaAcuerdos.depositoMeses}}
            <tr>
              <th>Depósito en garantía</th>
              <td>{{hojaAcuerdos.depositoMeses}} meses de renta</td>
            </tr>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if hojaAcuerdos.escalacionAnualPct}}
            <tr>
              <th>Escalación anual</th>
              <td>{{hojaAcuerdos.escalacionAnualPct}}%</td>
            </tr>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if esquemaComision}}
            <tr>
              <th>Esquema de comisión</th>
              <td>{{esquemaComision}}</td>
            </tr>
            {{/if}}
            <tr>
              <th>Inmueble</th>
              <td>
                Nave {{nave.identificador}}
                {{#if parque.nombre}} · {{parque.nombre}}{{/if}}
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        {{#if hojaAcuerdos.condicionesEspeciales}}
        <div class="special">
          <h3>Condiciones especiales</h3>
          <p>{{hojaAcuerdos.condicionesEspeciales}}</p>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        <p class="disclaimer">
          Este documento formaliza el acuerdo comercial preliminar. Está sujeto a
          due diligence, revisión legal y firma del contrato definitivo. No
          constituye por sí solo una obligación contractual final.
        </p>

        <p class="section-label">Firmas</p>
        <div class="signatures">
          <div class="signature">
            <div class="signature-line"></div>
            <p class="signature-role">Parks Industrial · CEM</p>
            <p class="signature-name">
              {{#if ejecutivoAsignado}}{{ejecutivoAsignado}}{{else}}Autorizado Parks{{/if}}
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="signature">
            <div class="signature-line"></div>
            <p class="signature-role">Cliente / Prospecto</p>
            <p class="signature-name">{{inquilino.empresa}}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer class="footer">
        <span>
          {{#if firmada}}<strong>Documento firmado</strong>{{else}}<strong>Borrador</strong>{{/if}}
          · Versión {{numeroVersion}}
        </span>
        <span>{{fechaGeneracion}} · Parks Industrial</span>
      </footer>
    </article>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
